flowchart LR
    FT[France Travail API<br/>Offres d'emploi v2] --> Producer[Python producer<br/>polling continu]
    Producer --> Kafka[(Kafka KRaft<br/>topic france-travail.offres.raw)]
    Geo[Geo API gouvernementale<br/>communes INSEE] --> Communes[Communes collector<br/>periodique]
    Communes --> LakeRawCommunes[/Data Lake<br/>raw/communes/]
    Kafka --> Aggregator[Raw aggregator<br/>commit apres ecriture durable]
    Aggregator --> LakeRawFT[(Volume data_lake<br/>raw/france_travail)]
    LakeRawCommunes --> Aggregator
    Aggregator --> LakeAgg[(Volume data_lake<br/>aggregated/offres JSONL)]
    LakeAgg --> Spark[PySpark batch<br/>validation dedupe curation]
    Spark --> LakeCurated[(Volume data_lake<br/>curated/offres Parquet)]
    Spark --> LakeQuarantine[(Volume data_lake<br/>quarantine JSON)]
    Spark --> Postgres[(PostgreSQL<br/>volume pgdata<br/>schema 3NF TP1 + audit TP2)]
    Postgres --> Metabase[Metabase<br/>dataviz]
    Postgres --> PgExporter[PostgreSQL exporter]
    Kafka --> KafkaExporter[Kafka exporter]
    Producer --> Prometheus[Prometheus]
    Communes --> Prometheus
    Aggregator --> Prometheus
    PgExporter --> Prometheus
    KafkaExporter --> Prometheus
    Prometheus --> Grafana[Grafana<br/>volume grafana_data<br/>dashboard provisionne]
    Kafka --> KafkaUI[Kafka UI]
